{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792592100, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T14:15:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T14:16:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792592160, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T14:15:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61983, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "車道最前方常劃設機車停等區，但機車常常需鑽行在汽車間才能抵達。請問是否能有更友善的規劃，謝謝市長！", "display_name": "松山代表 No.61,983", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T14:15:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53972, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "很多人反對交通違規檢舉人的制度，檢舉人惡意檢舉，地方政府把違規罰金視為財政一大來源，你有什麼看法？", "display_name": "大同代表 Wayne Chou (T)", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T14:15:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 63382, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "經濟", "content": "龍山寺前以前有活絡的龍山商場，但後來不知道哪個天兵改公園，經濟場所放個公園只會給遊民露營，希望該改回", "display_name": "萬華代表 Chris 棟", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T14:15:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34571, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "交通", "content": "很多禁行機車道（造成塞車）應該拿掉。例如松壽路-只有三線道其中兩道已被靠站公車/找停車位的汽車塞滿", "display_name": "信義代表 ⓢ", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 53972, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 Wayne Chou (T)", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 63382, "sprite_key": "bear_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 Chris 棟", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 34571, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "信義代表 ⓢ", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 68757, "sprite_key": "penguin_b